      ro: ["Ningbo-Zhoushan este primul port din lume care a depÄƒșit traficul anual de 1 miliard de tone de marfÄƒ.", "Biblioteca Tianyi Ge a fost fondatÄƒ Ã®n 1561 și adÄƒpostește peste 300.000 de volume vechi.", "Cultura Hemudu (5000â€“3300 Ã®.Hr.) de lÃ¢ngÄƒ Ningbo este consideratÄƒ un leagÄƒn al cultivÄƒrii orezului.", "Podul peste Golful Hangzhou leagÄƒ Ningbo de Shanghai și este unul dintre cele mai lungi poduri maritime.", "Templul Baoguo, construit Ã®n 1013, este una dintre cele mai vechi structuri din lemn din sudul Chinei.", "Ningbo a fost unul dintre cele cinci porturi deschise prin Tratatul de la Nanking Ã®n 1842."],
      en: ["Ningbo-Zhoushan Port was the first in the world to handle over 1 billion tons of cargo annually.", "The Tianyi Ge library, established in 1561, is the oldest existing private library in China.", "The Hemudu culture near Ningbo (5000â€“3300 BC) provides early evidence of rice cultivation.", "The Hangzhou Bay Bridge connects Ningbo to Shanghai and is among the longest sea-crossing bridges.", "Baoguo Temple, rebuilt in 1013 AD, features one of the oldest wooden structures in southern China.", "Ningbo was one of the original five treaty ports opened following the Treaty of Nanking in 1842."],
