      hu: ["Foshant tartjÃ¡k a dÃ©li harcművÃ©szeti iskolÃ¡k (Wing Chun Ã©s Hung Gar) szÃ¼lÅ‘helyÃ©nek.", "A Nanfeng-kemencÃ©t 1506-ban Ã©pÃ­tettÃ©k, Ã©s a vilÃ¡g legrÃ©gebbi, ma is műkÃ¶dÅ‘ kerÃ¡miaÃ©getÅ‘je.", "Az ÅsÃ¶k temploma (Zumiao) Beidi istensÃ©gnek, a vÃ­z vÃ©delmezÅ‘jÃ©nek van szentelve.", "Foshan Ã¡llÃ­tja elÅ‘ a vilÃ¡g hÃ¡ztartÃ¡si gÃ©peinek kÃ¶rÃ¼lbelÃ¼l egyharmadÃ¡t.", "A vÃ¡ros hÃ­res az oroszlÃ¡ntÃ¡ncrÃ³l, amely 2006-ban bekerÃ¼lt a nemzeti szellemi kulturÃ¡lis Ã¶rÃ¶ksÃ©gbe.", "Foshant KÃ­na elsÅ‘ vÃ¡roskÃ¶zi metrÃ³vonala (Guangfo Line) kÃ¶ti Ã¶ssze kÃ¶zvetlenÃ¼l Kantonnal."],
      ro: ["Foshan este considerat locul de origine al școlilor de arte marțiale sudice (Wing Chun și Hung Gar).", "Cuptorul Nanfeng a fost construit Ã®n 1506 și este cel mai vechi cuptor de ceramicÄƒ funcțional din lume.", "Templul StrÄƒmoșilor (Zumiao) este dedicat zeitÄƒții Beidi, protectorul apelor și al sudului.", "Foshan produce aproximativ o treime din totalul aparatelor electrocasnice la nivel mondial.", "Orașul este faimos pentru dansul leului, inclus Ã®n patrimoniul cultural imaterial Ã®n 2006.", "Foshan este conectat de Guangzhou prin prima linie de metrou interurbanÄƒ din China (Linia Guangfo)."],
      en: ["Foshan is recognized as the cradle of southern Chinese martial arts, including Wing Chun and Hung Gar.", "The Nanfeng Kiln was built in 1506 and is the world's oldest ceramic kiln still in use today.", "The Ancestral Temple (Zumiao) is dedicated to Beidi, the Northern God and protector of the region.", "Foshan accounts for approximately one-third of the global production of household appliances.", "The city is a center for the traditional lion dance, designated as national intangible heritage.", "Foshan is linked to Guangzhou by the Guangfo Line, China's first intercity subway system."],
