      hu: ["Zibo tÃ¶bb mint 800 Ã©ven Ã¡t volt az Ã³kori Qi Ã¡llam fÅ‘vÃ¡rosa.", "Sepp Blatter, a FIFA elnÃ¶ke 2004-ben hivatalosan is elismerte ZibÃ³t a labdarÃºgÃ¡s szÃ¼lÅ‘helyekÃ©nt.", "A vÃ¡rosban talÃ¡lhatÃ³ KÃ­na legnagyobb kerÃ¡miamÃºzeuma, tÃ¶bb mint 30 000 kiÃ¡llÃ­tÃ¡si tÃ¡rggyal.", "Pu Songling, a 'KÃ¼lÃ¶nÃ¶s tÃ¶rtÃ©netek' szerzÅ‘je 1640-ben szÃ¼letett Zibo Zichuan negyedÃ©ben.", "Zibo hÃ­res az Ã¼vegfestÃ©sÃ©rÅ‘l, amely művÃ©szeti Ã¡g a Tang-dinasztia Ã³ta lÃ©tezik.", "A vÃ¡ros Ã‰szak-KÃ­na egyik meghatÃ¡rozÃ³ petrolkÃ©miai gyÃ¡rtÃ¡si kÃ¶zpontja."],
      ro: ["Zibo a servit drept capitalÄƒ a statului Qi timp de peste 800 de ani Ã®n antichitate.", "ÃŽn 2004, FIFA a recunoscut oficial orașul Zibo drept locul unde a apÄƒrut fotbalul (Cuju).", "Orașul gÄƒzduiește cel mai mare muzeu al ceramicii din China, cu peste 30.000 de piese.", "Pu Songling, autorul celebrelor 'Povestiri ciudate', s-a nÄƒscut Ã®n Zibo Ã®n anul 1640.", "Zibo este renumit pentru pictura Ã®n interiorul flacoanelor de sticlÄƒ, o artÄƒ din epoca Tang.", "Orașul reprezintÄƒ un hub strategic pentru industria petrochimicÄƒ din nordul Chinei."],
      en: ["Zibo served as the capital of the State of Qi for more than 800 years in ancient times.", "In 2004, FIFA officially designated Zibo as the historical birthplace of soccer.", "The city is home to China's largest ceramics museum, showcasing over 30,000 items.", "Pu Songling, the author of 'Strange Tales from a Chinese Studio,' was born here in 1640.", "Zibo is a major center for the art of snuff bottle painting, dating back to the Tang Dynasty.", "The city is a significant national hub for petrochemical refining and chemical manufacturing."],
      es: ["Capital de Qi desde el siglo XI a. C.", "El Museo del Cuju documenta los orÃ­genes del fÃºtbol", "El distrito de Linzi alberga antiguos yacimientos arqueolÃ³gicos", "Importante productor de vidrio decorativo", "PoblaciÃ³n de aproximadamente 4,7 millones de habitantes", "Parte de la zona econÃ³mica del Mar Amarillo"],
      pt: ["Capital de Qi desde o sÃ©culo XI a. C.", "O Museu do Cuju documenta as origens do futebol", "O distrito de Linzi abriga antigos sÃ­tios arqueolÃ³gicos", "Importante produtor de vidro decorativo", "PopulaÃ§Ã£o de aproximadamente 4,7 milhÃµes de habitantes", "Parte da zona econÃ³mica do Mar Amarelo"],
