      en: ["Provincial capital of Hebei until 1958 and again from 1966 to 1968", "Home to the Western Qing Tombs, a UNESCO World Heritage site", "Total prefecture-level area covers 22,190 square kilometers", "Population of the prefecture-level city exceeds 11 million", "Famous for producing high-quality Baoding balls (exercise balls)", "The Governor-General's Office of Zhili is a well-preserved Qing government site"],
